      "nets": ["SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V", "GND"],
      "observed": "C13, a decoupling capacitor on the SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V rail, has value \"0.1mF 50V\" (100 µF) in footprint Capacitor_SMD:C_0603_1608Metric. Its own metadata contradicts this: LCSC C14663, MPN CC0603KRX7R9BB104, description \"50V 100nF X7R ±10% 0603\" — identical fields to C14, C25, C26, C30, C31, which are all labeled \"0.1uF 50V\". The SPICE deck likewise carries \"C13 0 SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V 0.1mF\".",
      "expected": "A 100 nF (0.1 µF) X7R 0603 MLCC, consistent with the part's MPN/description and with every other decoupling capacitor on the same rail. A 0.1 mF (100 µF) ceramic cannot exist in a 0603 package at 50 V, so the value field is off by 1000×.",
      "evidence": [
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(comp (ref \"C13\") (value \"0.1mF 50V\") (footprint \"Capacitor_SMD:C_0603_1608Metric\") ... (field (name \"MPN\") \"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\") ... (field (name \"Description\") \" 50V 100nF X7R ±10% 0603 Multilayer Ceramic Capacitors MLCC - SMD/SMT ROHS\"))"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(comp (ref \"C14\") (value \"0.1uF 50V\") ... (field (name \"MPN\") \"CC0603KRX7R9BB104\") ... (field (name \"Description\") \" 50V 100nF X7R ±10% 0603 Multilayer Ceramic Capacitors MLCC - SMD/SMT ROHS\"))"},
        {"source": "spice", "quote": "C13 0 SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V 0.1mF"},
        {"source": "netlist", "quote": "(net (code \"183\") (name \"SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V\") ... (node (ref \"C13\") (pin \"1\") ..."}
      ],
      "impact": "The value label is wrong by three orders of magnitude for a 100 nF decoupling position. Any BOM/assembly or simulation flow that trusts the value field would source an impossible 100 µF 0603 part or mis-model the rail's decoupling; the intended part per the MPN/LCSC fields is 0.1 µF. All other spec-stated items (16 MHz crystals Y1/Y2, SM712 TVS arrays D9/D10, LTC4412 U6, MCP2515 U8/U9, e-stop buffers, GLOBAL_EN direct-to-SW1, CAN breakout pinouts) check out, so this is the only deviation found.",
      "confidence": 0.85
    }
  ],
  "summary": "The design otherwise matches the specification (16 MHz CAN crystals, SM712 TVS diodes, LTC4412 ideal-diode path, e-stop sink buffers, CAN breakout on J2/J13), but C13's value field reads \"0.1mF\" while its own MPN/description and all sibling decouplers on SERIAL_CAN_PWR_3.3V are 0.1 µF — a 1000× mislabeled decoupling capacitor in a 0603 footprint."
}

